— WE REDREW profile icons and gifts, and now they move. We also added new icons, gifts and profile frames, and those come ONLY from the chest.

— New PRIZE CHEST for watching ads: 3 openings a day. It can drop TOGETHERLY+ forever or for a week, plus gifts, profile frames and icons, and coins. With Togetherly+ the chest opens without ads.

— COUPLE'S JAR: every ad either of you watches adds a drop. Collect 10 drops and each of you gets one more chest on top of the three. The jar fills up to twice a day.

— Any gift can be sent for watching an ad, up to three a day. A gift from the chest can go to your partner or stay with you.

— You can now attach your own photo to the "Photo" gift.

— A lost STREAK can be restored by watching an ad.

— DAILY TASKS grew to 400 and no longer repeat. There are tasks for your own video, and after three done a bonus task opens.

— CHAT got search and scheduled messages for any date and time. Double tap to react, and reactions are now drawings. Two new message looks: "Stickers" and "Pixel bubbles". Voice messages and video notes play one after another, video notes can be up to a minute long, and you can flip the camera while recording.

— "MISS YOU" shows today's history, and you can reply to each one.

— The feed has an "On this day" shelf: what happened a month, a year, two years ago.

— A TOGETHERLY WALLET button on the home screen. Join the waitlist and you will get a notification on launch day.

— The "Until we meet" widget updates by itself. "Partner's photo" can include photos from daily tasks, and every widget is readable on any theme.

— Deleting an account can now be undone within a week.

— Fixed: the days counter fell behind at night, drawings lost proportions on the second phone, erased strokes came back, the chat background disappeared. In "Want with you", unchecking an item no longer wipes its photo, price and link.
